  "description": "Downhill | 200mm Travel | ALX Alloy | MX Wheels\n\nWe never really left the DH scene, we just took the time to get it right. Born from the DNA of our EDR-proven COLLOSUS N enduro bike and tested for two seasons by the PFR team, the COLLOSUS DH mountain bike has been engineered to meet the demands of modern, aggressive riding. Proven at some of the biggest Freeride events such as Darkfest and Red Bull Rampage, versatility is at the core of the COLLOSUS DH. With an adjustable flip-chip system offering four geometry setups, riders can seamlessly transition between a stable 29er race machine and a flickable mullet set-up for the bike park. If you're looking for a long-travel gravity bike that balances precision engineering with pure riding enjoyment, your wait is over.",
